OL,3,GNEWSALorry driver banned after Prosecco
OL,4,Aspilled in crash                       
OL,6,FA lorry driver whose dangerous driving 
OL,7,Fleft Prosecco spilled over the M4 and  
OL,8,Fpart of the motorway shut for about    
OL,9,Fseven-and-a-half hours has been banned 
OL,10,Ffrom driving for a year.               
OL,12,FPiotr Tkaczyk, 41, was driving a       
OL,13,FMercedes lorry in Berkshire when it    
OL,14,Fclipped another vehicle, scoring       
OL,15,Fthrough the side his lorry, sending    
OL,16,Fbottles crashing onto the road.        
OL,18,FAn empty shipping container was knocked
OL,19,Fsideways and off the other lorry on 27 
OL,20,FApril.                                 
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
