OL,3,GNEWSALorry driver banned after Prosecco
OL,4,Aspilled in crash                       
OL,6,FTkaczyk, from Krakow in Poland,        
OL,7,Fadmitted dangerous driving. He was     
OL,8,Fgiven a 24-week prison term, suspended 
OL,9,Ffor 12 months, and ordered to pay #800 
OL,10,Fin compensation at Reading Magistrates'
OL,11,FCourt on 5 November.                   
